			"notes": "# [DOWNLOAD FROM MODRINTH INSTEAD](https://modrinth.com/mod/sky++)\n## GITHUB RELEASES WORK BUT MODRINTH IS PREFERRED\n\n## SkyPlusPlus\n\nYet another skyblock.net mod.\n\n### 1.6.0 Changelog\n\n- Add share button + /share command for [skyblock.onl's item share service](https://skyblock.onl/item).\n- More auto detected trader locations.\n- Add `/getheadtexture` - gets the skin URL of the head held in your hand.\n- Add Tool Saver\n- Add more server IPs to auto-detect (hypixel-skyblock.com, hypixel-skyblock.net, originalskyblock.com, skyblock-hypixel.com, hypixelsb.com).\n- Fix the chat filters to support bedrock players.\n- Fix message prefix.\n- Fix the visiting title check for usernames with underscores.\n- Fix the death message filter to support both message types.\n- Add `/getnbtjson`, debugging command to get NBT of held item as JSON."
		},
